**After (Fixed Code):**
```java
// File: src/main/java/com/example/cache/UserSessionCache.java
// Lines: 15-40
// Commit: def456abc789

public class UserSessionCache {
    private static final Cache<String, UserSession> cache = CacheBuilder.newBuilder()
        .maximumSize(10000)
        .expireAfterWrite(1, TimeUnit.HOURS)
        .expireAfterAccess(30, TimeUnit.MINUTES)
        .recordStats()
        .build();

    public void put(String userId, UserSession session) {
        cache.put(userId, session);
    }

    public UserSession get(String userId) {
        return cache.getIfPresent(userId);
    }

    public CacheStats getStats() {
        return cache.stats();
    }
}
```
